  1. Effects of Royal Jelly Administration on Endurance Training-Induced Mitochondrial Adaptations in Skeletal Muscle
     Yumiko Takahashi, Kamiyu Hijikata, Kohei Seike, Suguru Nakano, Mai Banjo, Yosuke Sato, Kenya Takahas...
     PMC6266893 · Nutrients · 2018-11-12
     https://doi.org/10.3390/nu10111735
     "Royal jelly was administered to mice undergoing endurance training to study its effects on muscle mitochondria. Royal jelly enhanced training-induced mitochondrial adaptations in soleus muscles by activating AMPK."

